* NMOS: Drain Gate Source
M1 2 7 0 NMOS
M1A 4 2 0 PMOS
M3A 5 2 0 PMOS
M3 6 3 0 NMOS
M11 2 2 0 PMOS

* Current Sources: Positive terminal -> Negative terminal
I3 7 2 DC 1u
I3A 2 5 DC 1u
I1A 2 4 DC 1u
I11 4 2 DC 1u

* Voltage Source: Positive terminal -> Negative terminal
Vdd 0 2 DC 2.5

* Simulation Commands
.tran 1n 100n
.op
.end